WEBVTT

00:02:01.629 --> 00:02:03.495
Calm down... Just calm down!

00:02:03.564 --> 00:02:05.862
It may be a Dark EIf,
but he's alone!

00:02:05.933 --> 00:02:08.493
If there's only one Dark EIf,
even I can handle it!

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:11.598
He can use magic to hide himself,
and that can be tricky...

00:02:11.672 --> 00:02:14.664
...but if I slash him before
he can do it, I can win!

00:02:14.742 --> 00:02:18.940
Besides, if I beat him,
they'll recognize me as a knight!

00:02:19.013 --> 00:02:21.345
This time, I can
finally become a knight!

00:02:25.352 --> 00:02:26.820
It's working! It's working!

00:02:28.989 --> 00:02:31.481
- "Tiny, invisible spirits..."
- You're not using any magic!

00:02:37.364 --> 00:02:38.661
I've got you!

00:02:41.635 --> 00:02:43.899
Im- Impossible! A fire spell?!

00:02:49.243 --> 00:02:51.473
Others were hiding themselves!

00:02:54.381 --> 00:02:57.214
Five to one...
There's no way I can win.

00:02:57.284 --> 00:03:00.117
What should I do?
What should I do?!

00:03:00.187 --> 00:03:03.987
If I turn my back on them,
I'm dead. But, if I don't...

00:03:04.058 --> 00:03:05.719
In that case...

00:03:15.502 --> 00:03:18.528
Intruders! Intruders!
Intruders by the treasure house!

00:03:19.707 --> 00:03:21.072
Intruders!

00:03:28.515 --> 00:03:30.415
Parn! Did you hear that?

00:03:30.484 --> 00:03:33.351
Yeah, I think it
came from over here.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:34.979
And I think it was...

00:03:35.356 --> 00:03:36.152
Who's there?!

00:03:38.192 --> 00:03:38.954
Spark!

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:42.657
Spark! Hang on! What happened?!

00:03:43.697 --> 00:03:47.133
D- Dark Elves got in...
the treasure house...

00:03:47.201 --> 00:03:48.225
What did you say?!

00:03:48.302 --> 00:03:50.964
Hurry... Seal the castle...

00:03:52.039 --> 00:03:52.767
Deed!

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:54.171
I'm on it!

00:03:54.908 --> 00:03:57.934
Come on!
Stay with us, Spark! Spark!

00:03:58.912 --> 00:04:00.573
Who are you?

00:04:00.647 --> 00:04:02.308
Leave this to me.

00:04:03.484 --> 00:04:09.821
"Myrii, great god of war.
Heal this brave man's wounds."

00:04:11.158 --> 00:04:12.182
Intruders!

00:04:12.259 --> 00:04:13.658
Seal the gates!

00:04:15.095 --> 00:04:16.585
They hit the treasure house!

00:04:16.663 --> 00:04:19.860
Seal the rear gates as well!
Search the castle grounds!

00:04:23.504 --> 00:04:25.336
What in the world...?!

00:04:25.406 --> 00:04:27.898
| was afraid this might happen.

00:04:28.342 --> 00:04:30.538
Highness! We're searching
the castle grounds...

00:04:30.611 --> 00:04:32.636
...but we can't find any
sign of the intruders.

00:04:32.713 --> 00:04:35.614
That's impossible! We raised the
drawbridge almost immediately!

00:04:35.682 --> 00:04:38.379
They must still be somewhere
on the castle grounds!

00:04:38.452 --> 00:04:41.854
Highness! If the intruders
really were Dark Elves...

00:04:41.922 --> 00:04:43.981
...they may have made
themselves invisible to escape.

00:04:44.057 --> 00:04:45.957
Shamanist magic?!

00:04:46.026 --> 00:04:48.552
But what could they have been after?

00:04:48.629 --> 00:04:51.860
The implements...
The implements of the Destroyer!

00:04:51.932 --> 00:04:53.923
Implements of the Destroyer?

00:04:54.802 --> 00:04:59.569
It's begun... A new calamity has
begun to take hold of Lodoss!

00:05:01.575 --> 00:05:02.906
How is Spark?

00:05:03.577 --> 00:05:07.138
Priest Greevus is administering
a healing spell now.

00:05:07.214 --> 00:05:08.943
According to him,
Spark should survive.

00:05:09.016 --> 00:05:11.644
Once he's been healed, have
Spark come to my chambers!

00:05:11.718 --> 00:05:12.617
Sir!

00:05:23.564 --> 00:05:26.556
Parn, Deed.
Would you come with us?

00:05:31.538 --> 00:05:34.997
| will explain the
situation to you two directly.

00:05:35.075 --> 00:05:36.907
However, no others
need to know this.

00:05:37.845 --> 00:05:40.371
If the soldiers or our
citizens knew any of this...

00:05:40.447 --> 00:05:42.211
...it might cause a panic.

00:05:44.251 --> 00:05:47.983
The truth is, we have
recently discovered that...

00:05:48.055 --> 00:05:51.047
...the Marmo have embarked
upon a terrible plan.

00:05:51.558 --> 00:05:53.549
A terrible plan? What?

00:05:55.863 --> 00:05:58.332
The resurrection
of Kardis the Destroyer!

00:05:58.398 --> 00:06:03.063
Kardis the Destroyer?! Why do
they want to resurrect Kardis?!

00:06:03.136 --> 00:06:05.503
Kardis was born
to destroy the world!

00:06:05.572 --> 00:06:08.041
She's the goddess of
destruction, right?!

00:06:08.108 --> 00:06:14.536
Yes... And Kardis was one of
the two gods who created Lodoss.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:20.378
In the War of the Gods,
in which the forces of light...

00:06:20.454 --> 00:06:23.913
...fought against the forces of
darkness, Marfa,

00:06:23.991 --> 00:06:28.394
the goddess of the earth fought
against Kardis the Destroyer.

00:06:29.363 --> 00:06:33.163
It was a battle of supreme
heroism and ferocity.

00:06:33.233 --> 00:06:37.534
At last, Marfa used her
power to seal Kardis away.

00:06:37.604 --> 00:06:42.508
But before she was sealed,
Kardis cursed the earth.

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:50.774
Marfa, already mortally wounded
in her battle with Kardis...

00:06:50.851 --> 00:06:53.616
...used the last of her
power to perform a miracle.

00:06:54.855 --> 00:06:57.222
To save the continent...

00:06:59.226 --> 00:07:02.423
...she split the
cursed land away from it!

00:07:04.431 --> 00:07:07.332
That cursed land
is the island of Lodoss.

00:07:07.401 --> 00:07:09.563
But what are they trying to do?!

00:07:09.636 --> 00:07:12.071
If they resurrect Kardis,
it'll be the end of the world!

00:07:12.139 --> 00:07:15.973
A sane person would want to
resurrect Falaris,

00:07:16.043 --> 00:07:17.704
the god of darkness.

00:07:17.778 --> 00:07:20.941
All we can pray is
that they aren't madmen.

00:07:21.648 --> 00:07:23.207
So, who's behind this?

00:07:23.283 --> 00:07:26.446
The dark priests?
The leader of the Dark Elves?

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:31.082
No. As far as I know, there
is only one person in Marmo...

00:07:31.158 --> 00:07:33.490
...who has the desire to
make this plan reality.

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:34.721
You mean...

00:07:34.795 --> 00:07:36.991
The dark wizard Wagnard!

00:07:38.799 --> 00:07:44.897
<i>“Ladeera...Nani iru vey Kardis...
Ana adaru nees.."</i>

00:07:45.172 --> 00:07:48.767
Just wait...
You SHALL be resurrected!

00:07:48.842 --> 00:07:50.936
Kardis the Destroyer!

00:07:51.311 --> 00:07:54.406
And the implements of the
Destroyer that were stolen...

00:07:54.481 --> 00:07:56.506
...were something they
need to resurrect Kardis?

00:07:56.583 --> 00:08:01.419
Yes. "Two keys, one door, and
Kardis shall awaken once more."

00:08:01.488 --> 00:08:02.922
Is that a legend?

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:05.516
The two keys are the two implements.

00:08:05.592 --> 00:08:09.859
The one door is the live sacrifice
for the advent of Kardis.

00:08:10.497 --> 00:08:14.331
When those three things are brought
together, Kardis shall be reborn.

00:08:14.401 --> 00:08:16.597
What was stolen was
one of the implements:

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:18.638
The Soul Crystal Ball.

00:08:18.705 --> 00:08:23.233
The Governor's Treasure guarded
by the Ancient Dragon Abram!

00:08:23.877 --> 00:08:28.007
I took it from Maar and stored
it in the treasure house here.

00:08:28.448 --> 00:08:30.280
And what is the other implement?

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:34.753
The Staff of Life, which is held
in the temple of Falis in Valis.

00:08:35.389 --> 00:08:36.948
Then that must be
their next target...!

00:08:37.024 --> 00:08:41.222
Calm down, Parn. If we attack
the Marmo, we'll stop them.

00:08:41.294 --> 00:08:42.056
But...!

00:08:42.129 --> 00:08:43.528
Don't worry.

00:08:43.597 --> 00:08:46.066
I'll send a dispatch
about this to Valis.

00:08:46.133 --> 00:08:49.626
King Etoh will easily arrange
things with the temple of Falis.

00:08:49.703 --> 00:08:51.398
Leave the job to the right people.

00:08:55.008 --> 00:08:58.638
He's right, Parn.
We can leave this to Etoh.

00:09:01.281 --> 00:09:04.251
Of course, I'm sending out a
pursuit team after the intruders.

00:09:04.317 --> 00:09:07.753
If we can recover the
stolen Soul Crystal Ball...

00:09:07.821 --> 00:09:10.188
...we'll have nothing
to get excited about.

00:09:10.257 --> 00:09:12.749
Then Highness,
I have a favor to ask!

00:09:14.161 --> 00:09:16.220
It's Spark, Highness.
Reporting as ordered.

00:09:17.664 --> 00:09:18.893
Enter!

00:09:38.452 --> 00:09:40.079
Why, Spark?

00:09:41.354 --> 00:09:43.914
Why didn't you immediately give
the alarm about the intruders?!

00:09:43.990 --> 00:09:46.015
| beg your pardon, Highness.

00:09:46.093 --> 00:09:48.289
| asked you why you
didn't raise the alarm!

00:09:48.361 --> 00:09:51.524
| wanted... I wanted
to try and beat him myself!

00:09:52.466 --> 00:09:55.060
If I could beat him, then you'd have
to see I was ready to be a knight!

00:09:55.135 --> 00:09:57.001
That's what I thought, anyway...

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:59.261
I'm prepared to accept
my punishment!

00:09:59.339 --> 00:10:02.536
As well you should! I'll send out
orders for you to join the pursuit.

00:10:02.609 --> 00:10:04.407
You can wait in the
guard room till I give them!

00:10:06.646 --> 00:10:10.742
Did you hear? Sounds like
a big battle's about to start.

00:10:10.817 --> 00:10:14.811
Looks like the king's ready to
have a showdown with the Marmo.

00:10:14.888 --> 00:10:17.858
We haven't had a war in ten years.

00:10:18.258 --> 00:10:20.352
| was starting to think
the fighting was finally over.

00:10:20.427 --> 00:10:21.826
What are you talking about?!

00:10:21.895 --> 00:10:24.887
I hear those intruders last
night were Marmo agents!

00:10:24.965 --> 00:10:28.299
Yeah, and they got away
with some treasure, too.

00:10:28.368 --> 00:10:30.803
What were those guards doing?!

00:10:30.871 --> 00:10:32.236
Besides that--

00:10:32.305 --> 00:10:34.000
Quiet down!

00:10:40.447 --> 00:10:43.075
Here're your assignments for today.

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:46.279
Sir Farus, you go to
fortress 12 in the west!

00:10:46.353 --> 00:10:47.184
Sir!

00:10:47.754 --> 00:10:51.156
Sir Bohnu and Sir Dagral,
will go to fortress 18 in the north.

00:10:51.224 --> 00:10:52.191
Sir!

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:57.087
Sir Tahgi and Sir Rudolf,
fortress 8 in the east!

00:10:57.164 --> 00:10:58.097
Sir!

00:11:01.668 --> 00:11:04.535
None of the other treasures
were even touched.

00:11:05.338 --> 00:11:08.569
They only took
the Soul Crystal Ball...

00:11:11.978 --> 00:11:16.211
| thought the treasure house had a
high-level protection spell on it...

00:11:16.283 --> 00:11:18.980
...yet they stole
the crystal easily.

00:11:19.052 --> 00:11:22.579
It seems the intruders had a
mage of some real power among them.

00:11:24.958 --> 00:11:26.119
Master Slayn!

00:11:28.461 --> 00:11:30.987
Forgive me, Master Slayn.

00:11:31.064 --> 00:11:34.056
As the keeper of the treasure
house, this is my responsibility.

00:11:34.134 --> 00:11:38.230
No, this isn't your
fault, Aldonova.

00:11:38.305 --> 00:11:41.172
First of all, I was the one
who cast the protection spell here.

00:11:41.241 --> 00:11:43.335
If responsibility is to be taken,
it should be done so by me.

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:46.277
Master, the doorway...
What about the doorway?

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:48.643
The doorway is safe.

00:11:48.715 --> 00:11:53.243
Thank goodness... Then please
order me to be her protector.

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:55.186
Even if it costs me
my life, I'll...

00:11:56.456 --> 00:12:00.359
I really appreciate your intentions,
but I can't allow that.

00:12:01.094 --> 00:12:02.493
But why, Master?

00:12:02.562 --> 00:12:06.192
The truthiis, I have
a favor to ask of you.

00:12:06.766 --> 00:12:09.565
Sir Carlberos will go to
fortress 6 in the south.

00:12:09.636 --> 00:12:10.398
Sir!

00:12:13.306 --> 00:12:15.240
C- Captain! Wait, please!

00:12:15.308 --> 00:12:18.369
What about...
What about MY assignment, sir?!

00:12:19.112 --> 00:12:19.772
Your assignment?

00:12:19.846 --> 00:12:21.746
The king ordered
me to wait here...

00:12:21.815 --> 00:12:24.045
...until he decided what
my assignment would be!

00:12:24.117 --> 00:12:26.176
Well, I haven't
heard anything about that.

00:12:26.253 --> 00:12:27.743
| see, sir...

00:12:40.533 --> 00:12:42.695
Is there an idiot glory-hound...

00:12:42.769 --> 00:12:45.761
...who let the intruders
get away named Spark in here?

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:49.168
I'm that idiot!

00:12:49.242 --> 00:12:51.210
I've got orders from Lord Shadam.

00:12:51.278 --> 00:12:53.406
As of today, you're my captain.

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:54.709
The name's Garrack. As you
can see, I'm a mercenary.

00:12:54.781 --> 00:12:56.442
The name's Garrack. As you
can see, I'm a mercenary.

00:12:56.516 --> 00:13:00.612
'Cuz of this scar here, people
like to call me the Blue Meteor.

00:13:00.687 --> 00:13:02.121
You can, too, if you want to.

00:13:02.188 --> 00:13:04.885
Well, in any case,
it's a pleasure to meet you!

00:13:05.292 --> 00:13:10.696
<i>W-Hold on a second! Orders?
Your captain? What do you mean?!</i>

00:13:10.764 --> 00:13:13.426
I'm supposed
to be under punishment!

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.628
If you want to tease someone,
then do it to someone else!

00:13:15.702 --> 00:13:17.796
Um, uh... Excuse me, but...

00:13:18.238 --> 00:13:21.674
What? I'm hooked up
with YOU, Garrack?

00:13:22.108 --> 00:13:23.041
Leaf?!

00:13:23.109 --> 00:13:24.304
I KNEW there was
something wrong with this job!

00:13:24.377 --> 00:13:26.209
I KNEW there was
something wrong with this job!

00:13:26.813 --> 00:13:28.679
That should be MY line!

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:33.317
Hey! This is no place
for women or children!

00:13:37.424 --> 00:13:38.687
Outta my way, pal!

00:13:39.793 --> 00:13:42.194
Okay, Garrack, who's our captain?

00:13:45.065 --> 00:13:46.829
Huh?! You're kidding!

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:50.226
You think I should
apologize to him?

00:13:50.303 --> 00:13:53.329
Well, you know making a
good or bad impression...

00:13:53.406 --> 00:13:57.070
...on the captain affects payment.

00:13:57.143 --> 00:13:59.737
Just what are you two doing?!

00:13:59.813 --> 00:14:03.977
I'm REALLY sorry, sir! I didn't
think you were the captain!

00:14:04.517 --> 00:14:06.679
I'm Leaf, a Half-EIf.

00:14:06.753 --> 00:14:09.188
And despite appearances,
I'm a merc, like Garrack here.

00:14:09.255 --> 00:14:10.654
How do you do?

00:14:12.759 --> 00:14:13.885
Okay...

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.724
Is Spark in here?

00:14:15.795 --> 00:14:18.765
ANOTHER one?
Great... Now who's--

00:14:19.733 --> 00:14:21.724
H- Highness!

00:14:25.138 --> 00:14:27.766
Knight in training
Spark, here are your orders!

00:14:27.841 --> 00:14:28.808
Yes, sir!

00:14:29.776 --> 00:14:32.677
You are to carry a dispatch
to the king of Valis.

00:14:32.746 --> 00:14:34.373
You will set out for Valis at once!

00:14:35.315 --> 00:14:38.341
However, we've received word that
the intruders from last night...

00:14:38.418 --> 00:14:41.046
...have fled to the south,
towards Valis.

00:14:41.121 --> 00:14:44.091
Therefore, I've chosen a special
team. You will command them...

00:14:44.157 --> 00:14:45.124
...and pursue the intruders.

00:14:45.191 --> 00:14:49.424
Recover the treasure,
a stolen crystal ball!

00:14:49.763 --> 00:14:53.256
H- Highness, does this mean
my honor has been restored?

00:14:53.333 --> 00:14:56.894
Don't get too hasty, Spark!
While we're in this state of war...

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:59.337
...you have your orders
as a knight in training!

00:14:59.406 --> 00:15:02.865
I don't expect you to come back
here until your mission is complete!

00:15:03.143 --> 00:15:04.133
Yes, sir!

00:15:05.178 --> 00:15:07.203
Even if it costs me my life!

00:15:15.055 --> 00:15:16.045
Priest Greevus!

00:15:16.556 --> 00:15:18.888
Here, you forgot something.

00:15:18.958 --> 00:15:21.450
How do you expect to
fight the intruders without it?

00:15:21.928 --> 00:15:24.693
My sword...
Thank you very much, Priest!

00:15:26.199 --> 00:15:29.533
Highness, I'd like to
accompany their party.

00:15:29.769 --> 00:15:32.932
Priest... It's all right
with me, but why?

00:15:33.306 --> 00:15:37.368
Because I like this knight.
Do I really need a reason?

00:15:37.444 --> 00:15:40.880
This knight left his sword behind
in order to escape the enemy.

00:15:40.947 --> 00:15:43.814
To my thinking, that takes
a kind of courage to do.

00:15:43.883 --> 00:15:44.975
Priest...

00:15:45.051 --> 00:15:49.784
Men who use swords occasionally
forget that they're just tools.

00:15:49.856 --> 00:15:53.087
There are those who feel a sword
is worth more than their lives...

00:15:53.159 --> 00:15:56.493
...but the god of war
has taught me otherwise.

00:15:56.563 --> 00:15:58.497
Isn't that right, Miss?

00:16:00.733 --> 00:16:02.201
Are you sure, sir?

00:16:02.268 --> 00:16:04.703
It's all right. As a priest
of the god of war...

00:16:04.771 --> 00:16:07.934
...my job isn't simply
to instruct others.

00:16:08.141 --> 00:16:10.803
Highness, will this be all
the members of our party?

00:16:11.377 --> 00:16:14.677
One more will be coming as well.
It looks like they're late.

00:16:15.181 --> 00:16:18.446
Good timing, then. Spark, would
you come with me for a bit?

00:16:18.785 --> 00:16:21.117
Yes, sir! I don't mind, but...

00:16:21.187 --> 00:16:22.177
This way.

00:16:22.255 --> 00:16:23.416
<i>Y-Yes?</i>

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:30.427
This is the training room...

00:16:30.497 --> 00:16:31.191
Here!

00:16:31.264 --> 00:16:33.790
Huh? What are you...?

00:16:33.867 --> 00:16:36.962
We didn't come here to talk.

00:16:37.036 --> 00:16:39.004
| wanted to see
how good you've gotten.

00:16:40.507 --> 00:16:43.670
According to the king,
you've gotten pretty skilled.

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:45.939
N- Not really...

00:16:46.012 --> 00:16:48.174
Maybe you want
someone better than me?

00:16:48.248 --> 00:16:50.307
No, sir! This is an honor!

00:16:50.383 --> 00:16:53.478
Getting to match swords with Parn,
the legendary free knight...

00:16:53.553 --> 00:16:55.544
...is a like a dream
come true for me!

00:16:56.389 --> 00:16:58.118
Well, shall we begin?

00:16:58.224 --> 00:16:59.783
Yes, sir!

00:17:03.596 --> 00:17:06.361
When you cross swords, let no one
distract you from your opponent!

00:17:06.599 --> 00:17:08.795
If this was the battlefield,
| would have killed you!

00:17:08.868 --> 00:17:09.835
Y- Yes, sir!

00:17:14.607 --> 00:17:15.904
Your charge was predictable!

00:17:20.213 --> 00:17:23.183
Study your opponent's moves!
Then predict his next one!

00:17:24.651 --> 00:17:26.585
Consider your attack strategy!

00:17:26.653 --> 00:17:28.815
You can't win on
raw strength alone!

00:17:28.888 --> 00:17:29.912
Right!

00:17:35.695 --> 00:17:37.424
If you don't get a chance
to hit your opponent...

00:17:37.497 --> 00:17:39.727
...keep on attacking
until you get it!

00:17:39.832 --> 00:17:43.393
| see why King Kashue has
such hopes for him! He's good!

00:17:48.408 --> 00:17:52.436
Thank you very much. I'll never
forget what you taught me, Sir Parn!

00:17:53.179 --> 00:17:55.011
Complete your mission safely.

00:17:55.081 --> 00:17:58.107
Yes, sir! I'll never fail
again like I did last night...

00:17:58.184 --> 00:18:00.653
...when I forgot
what my real duty was.

00:18:01.387 --> 00:18:02.377
Don't do that, either.

00:18:02.455 --> 00:18:03.752
Don't do that? But why not?

00:18:03.823 --> 00:18:06.224
Don't just abandon yourself.

00:18:06.826 --> 00:18:10.626
Don't become a man who only
lives for the duty given to him.

00:18:11.798 --> 00:18:13.789
Some day, you'll understand.

00:18:21.074 --> 00:18:23.600
Hey, Captain!
The last member's arrived!

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:28.676
Forgive my being late.
| am the wizard Aldonova.

00:18:28.748 --> 00:18:31.012
Forgive my being late.
| am the wizard Aldonova.

00:18:31.618 --> 00:18:33.677
It's a pleasure to meet
you, Master Spark.

00:18:34.554 --> 00:18:36.352
Just Spark, please.

00:18:36.422 --> 00:18:39.585
We've had a sighting of the intruders
from fortress 18 in the south!

00:18:40.026 --> 00:18:42.757
Master Spark,
please move out at once!

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.162
Understood.
We'll leave immediately!

00:18:55.842 --> 00:18:57.640
You're sure about this, Parn?

00:18:58.011 --> 00:19:01.174
For better or worse,
battle changes people.

00:19:01.381 --> 00:19:03.543
I think this will do him some good.

00:19:03.616 --> 00:19:09.817
He doesn't suspect that the thing he
seeks may determine Lodoss's future.

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:13.584
Well, Highness, we'll be
returning to Kanon.

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:15.287
Good luck in your
battle with the Marmo.

00:19:15.361 --> 00:19:18.126
Yes. And let us
meet again soon.

00:19:20.833 --> 00:19:23.700
And now, Lodoss has
begun to move again.

00:19:25.238 --> 00:19:27.707
Towards a new future!

00:19:43.289 --> 00:19:45.690
Welcome to Lodoss Island!

00:19:45.758 --> 00:19:48.227
And now, what you've been waiting
for, the second part of the show!

00:19:52.665 --> 00:19:58.229
| am Spark, knight of Flaim!
SPARK!

00:19:59.138 --> 00:20:01.402
...is what I hoped
| could say, but...

00:20:01.641 --> 00:20:03.769
What are you doing
over there, Spark?

00:20:03.843 --> 00:20:06.244
I'm gonna leave you behind!

00:20:06.679 --> 00:20:08.340
Right, right. Coming.

00:20:10.049 --> 00:20:12.711
I know this is supposed to give
me experience as a knight...

00:20:12.785 --> 00:20:14.810
...but delivering cookies...!

00:20:14.887 --> 00:20:16.582
What are you saying, Spark?

00:20:16.656 --> 00:20:19.751
Guarding people is an
important job for a knight!

00:20:19.826 --> 00:20:21.385
Well, I guess so, but...

00:20:22.362 --> 00:20:25.297
First of all, who would attack
us for some lousy cookies?

00:20:25.365 --> 00:20:28.391
I don't think protecting these
will give me much experience.

00:20:34.741 --> 00:20:35.435
Spark!

00:20:36.943 --> 00:20:38.934
| thought I was gonna die...!

00:20:40.246 --> 00:20:44.649
80, your defender narrowly
escapes with his life...

00:20:44.717 --> 00:20:45.912
Who's there?!

00:20:45.985 --> 00:20:47.749
I've been waiting for you, Neese!

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:49.413
You're...!

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:53.525
...the Dark EIf with a sweet tooth!

00:20:53.593 --> 00:20:55.061
Did you say Dark EIf?!

00:20:55.361 --> 00:20:58.160
I've heard that the cookies
baked at the temple of Marfa...

00:20:58.231 --> 00:20:59.995
...have a taste beyond compare!

00:21:00.066 --> 00:21:04.060
Now hand over those
cookies quietly! Huh?!

00:21:04.837 --> 00:21:07.397
What a terrible thing to have
happen. Are you okay?

00:21:07.473 --> 00:21:09.066
Yeah, I think so.

00:21:09.142 --> 00:21:11.839
Hold it! Hold it! HO-O-O-LD IT™

00:21:11.911 --> 00:21:13.845
You listen when
somebody's talking to you!

00:21:13.913 --> 00:21:16.939
If you insult me, prepare
to taste my wrath!

00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:18.813
Hey!

00:21:24.123 --> 00:21:25.989
Thanks, little dragon!

00:21:27.627 --> 00:21:29.186
Okay, let's go!

00:21:30.296 --> 00:21:34.790
I've got SUCH a bad
feeling about what's ahead...

00:22:59.785 --> 00:23:02.277
Pursuing our enemies,
we find waiting for us...

00:23:02.355 --> 00:23:05.154
...a terrible trap
set by the Dark Elves!

00:23:05.224 --> 00:23:07.784
An enormous monster
attacks the fortress!

00:23:07.860 --> 00:23:09.954
As I face my first real battle...

00:23:10.029 --> 00:23:12.930
...a lone girl appears
in a burst of light!

00:23:14.233 --> 00:23:18.170
Next time, on Record of Lodoss War -
Chronicles of the Heroic Knight:

00:23:18.237 --> 00:23:21.207
“Light...
A Girl Guided by the Gods."
